","preview":"最近从安姆到博德之门的航线越来越不太平了！我上个月雇佣了三艘商船运送一批香料和丝绸，结果在宝剑海遇到了两波海盗，甚至还有一只疑似海怪的触手袭击了护卫舰。博德之门的焰拳兵团最近是不是缩减了海上巡逻？厄尔德·瑞文嘉德大公爵难道不管管吗？各位同行最近走这条线一定要多雇几个塑能系法师！","boardTag":"费伦-剑湾","author":"海风金币","stats":"❤️6  💬10","postId":1782846406467,"isOwnPost":false,"isAnon":false,"isAuthoredByChar":false},"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":112},{"id":1782841186868,"text":"外面雨好大","sender":"me","time":"03:19","timestamp":1782847154622,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":113},{"id":1782841186869,"text":"我在论坛看到这个","sender":"me","time":"03:19","timestamp":1782847161043,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":114},{"id":1782841186870,"text":"你看","sender":"me","time":"03:19","timestamp":1782847168268,"replyTo":{"id":1782841186867,"text":"[费伦-剑湾] 宝剑海最近的航线太危险了，同行们注意！","sender":"me","isSimulated":false},"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":115},{"id":1782841186871,"text":"我们还没做过海盗耶","sender":"me","time":"03:19","timestamp":1782847173241,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":116},{"id":1782841186873,"sender":"them","text":"是呀，雨下得好大……我刚才听到雨声，怕三楼温室的窗户没关好才出来看一眼的，马上就回被窝里去陪您……","timestamp":1782847217166,"tempo":"N","hasThinking":true,"rawContent":"是呀，雨下得好大……我刚才听到雨声，怕三楼温室的窗户没关好才出来看一眼的，马上就回被窝里去陪您……","roundId":"round_1782847175086_zy1askm0v","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":117},{"id":1782841186874,"sender":"them","text":"不过……亲爱的想做海盗吗？","timestamp":1782847220134,"tempo":"S","rawContent":"不过……亲爱的想做海盗吗？","roundId":"round_1782847175086_zy1askm0v","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":118},{"id":1782841186875,"sender":"them","text":"如果是您当海盗